@FitPlan.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5264

# Paste the accessToken you get from Register / Login here (do not commit real tokens).
@token = paste-access-token-here


### Register
POST {{FitPlan.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "eyad",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}




### Login
POST {{FitPlan.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "eyad",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}


### Get My Profile
GET {{FitPlan.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}




### Update Profile
PUT {{FitPlan.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Software Engineer passionate about backend development."
}


### upload Profile Picture
POST {{FitPlan.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profile/me/picture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FitPlanBoundary

--FitPlanBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:\Users\Eyadm\Downloads\testpic2.jpg
--FitPlanBoundary--




### Delete Profile Picture
DELETE {{FitPlan.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profile/me/picture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}




### Test ExerciseDB
GET https://oss.exercisedb.dev/api/v1/exercises
Accept: application/json



### Test ExerciseDB - Next Page
GET https://oss.exercisedb.dev/api/v1/exercises?after=0JtKWum
Accept: application/json




### Get All Exercises from database
GET {{FitPlan.Api_HostAddress}}/api/exercises
Accept: application/json
